     "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-shp.txt",
     "text": "Jains̈honribira non jato amayamatima iqui, jato namanbires icá mainconia joni, jainoas̈h huetsa mainconia joni inonbi, non jato amaresti iqui."
